      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n\n6. Concurrency & Reliability — Main Focus\n\n- Database transactions with @Transactional\n- Pessimistic locking\n- Optimistic locking with @Version\n- Prevent inventory overselling\n- Handle simultaneous customer orders\n- Prevent duplicate driver/order assignments\n- Rollback and exception handling\n- Automated concurrency tests",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n\n6. Concurrency & Reliability — Main Focus\n\n- Database transactions with @Transactional\n- Pessimistic locking\n- Optimistic locking with @Version\n- Prevent inventory overselling\n- Handle simultaneous customer orders\n- Prevent duplicate driver/order assignments\n- Rollback and exception handling\n- Automated concurrency tests",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
